-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$150</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.43.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">November 1st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<i><big>\"I'm literally losing my marbles over this! They roll everywhere, ugh.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Marbles can be purchased at <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> for $150.\nWhen unboxed, marbles reveal a variety of sizes and colors. Each time you open a box, a different variant will be revealed.\n</p><p>There are 3 sizes and 10 colors:\n<span style=\"color:#fff; background-color: black;\">Quill grey</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#000; background-color: white;\">black</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#f00;\">Tr, Red</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#0f0;\">Bright green</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#00f;\">Royal blue</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#0ff;\">Med. bluish green</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#ffa500;\">Bright orange</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#5338a5;\">Royal purple</span>,\n<span style=\"color:#9d23b1;\">pink</span> and \n<span style=\"color:#e9e431;\">Curry</span>.\n</p><p>It's also possible to get a gold marble. The exact chance is 1/1,000.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 479px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/59/Marble_collection_oaklands.png/revision/latest?cb=20250903195911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"full marble collection\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/59/Marble_collection_oaklands.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/479?cb=20250903195911\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"479\" height=\"168\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Marble collection oaklands.png\" data-image-key=\"Marble_collection_oaklands.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Marble_collection_oaklands.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">full marble collection</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Marble's Box still has no decal on it.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902024544\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU tim